## MAINTENANCE & TROUBLESHOOTING

### Weekly Maintenance (5 minutes)

```powershell
# Check queue health
python -c "from agents.research.queue import get_queue_stats; print(get_queue_stats())"

# Review logs
Get-Content _research/logs/*.log -Tail 50

# Check disk space (models are large)
(Get-ChildItem $env:USERPROFILE\.ollama -Recurse | Measure-Object -Property Length -Sum).Sum / 1GB
```

### Common Issues

| Issue | Cause | Fix |
|-------|-------|-----|
| "Ollama not found" | Service not running | `ollama serve` in terminal |
| "Model not found" | Gemma 3 not downloaded | `ollama pull gemma3:4b` |
| Research queue empty | Scheduled task not running | Check Task Scheduler status |
| Slow research | CPU-only mode | Normal for 4B model, ~2-3 min per query |
| JSON parse errors | LLM output format | Check `_research/inbox/` for raw output |

### Cost Analysis

| Component | Cost | Notes |
|-----------|------|-------|
| Ollama | $0 | Open source |
| Gemma 3 | $0 | Open weights |
| smolagents | $0 | Open source |
| Web search | $0 | DuckDuckGo (default) |
| Electricity | ~$5/mo | Running 4B model on CPU |
| **Total** | **~$5/mo** | vs $200/mo for OpenAI Deep Research |

